+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "---"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "id": "e5b7f0f6-2f27-4bdd-998e-306d1da7e064",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "### Gene expressions"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "id": "d6343944-00dd-4d66-be2e-b7e97535650b",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "#### • Gene expressions of a particular **gene** can be searched in each region\n",
+    "#### • Inside each region multiple *gene expressions* were measured (for a *single gene*), corresponding with *multiple donors*\n",
